<title>USA: Imperial Bancorp approves stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Imperial Bancorp approves stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Bancorp said Friday its board had approved the repurchase of up to one million shares.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made from time to time depending on market conditions, it said.</p>
<p>Imperial Bancorp said it has about 23.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
